  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Some simple notes about this issue:\n\n- This issue doesn't always occur, but when it begins occuring, it continues to happen consistently until the player moves/the chatbox is moved/a new world is loaded before occuring again later.\n\n- I think this might occur when there's a canvas behind the keyboard that the pointer is attempting to reach from between the keys but I'm not 100% sure.\n\n- This issue might be influenced by dynamic/grabbable and unlocked menu options being enabled.\n\n- This issue might be influenced by the keyboard being tilted/facing a weird angle as I often encounter this when typing while lying down.\n\n- This issue may be influenced by the use of horizon adjust, as I also use this often.\n\nI don't have time to collect media or write a proper description for this but wanted to report it regardless.",
